            "review_text": "Kcire M\n1 contribution\n0\nSexist male cooks at Steak Buffet Line-Only gives extra steaks to females.\nFeb 2026 • Family\nThis place was horrible, and so was the steak line. It charges so much, but when I lined up for the stake, they gave me such small portions. If you ask for more, they say no. They literally give you 3 or 4 small cuts like you're a beggar, even though you're paying so much. But a woman in front of me asked for more, and the male cook kept giving her. This happened twice. But when I asked for more or other men asked for more, they would say no. They choose and pick who to give more to. I complained to the manager and he came to my table and provided more steaks which we didn't touch. It's not about the steak, it's about being equal to all the customers and not just picking and choosing which girl you want to give more food to. We are all equal in paying so this establishment and it's poorly trained employees should treat all customers equally.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nHave your employees be fair to all employees, especially the male cooks at the steak line who trip over their small access to power\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 29, 2026",
