            "review_text": "Dao2024\nChiang Mai, Thailand1586 contributions\n0\nExcessive Loud Band made it Impossible for Us to Enjoy Being Inside the Building and Unpleasant to enjoy the Buffet!\nJun 2023 • Couples\nMy wife & I were staying at the Mercure Hotel and we decided to have dinner at the Beer Plaza. We paid nearly $45.00 for our entry tickets and proceeded to walk over to give the tickets to the next receptionist. Within a few steps, the band on the ground floor began playing super loud music! It was so loud we could not even have a normal conversation and had to yell at each other. We both agreed that the music volume was excessive and intolerable. So we went back to the receptionist and explained to her that the music was too loud and we asked for our money to be refunded. She laughed and replied, We are sorry but we cannot refund your money. Then she said-The band only plays for 20 minutes. Well, after thinking it over, I asked her-How many 20 minute performances doe the band do? She laughed again and said something that I could not even hear or understand. Then I became very angry and I told her-I want my F-king Money refunded Now and I slammed my fist on her counter. She finally said Ok and gave me back my money! The was the most terrible and annoying experience I have ever had on many of my world travels! We will never return there and suggest that you FIRST listen to the loudness of the band before you buy the tickets!!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nWritten June 30, 2023",
